{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/389895-blood-and-smoke-at-story-sanctum","id":389895,"title":"Blood and smoke at Story Sanctum","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-02T08:45:39-08:00","id":389895,"title":"Blood and smoke at Story Sanctum","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.storysanctum.com/forum/viewtopic.php?f=22&amp;t=942\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.storysanctum.com/forum/viewtopic.php?f=22&amp;t=942\" target=\"_blank\"> Just a moment... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.storysanctum.com/forum/viewtopic.php?f=22&amp;t=942\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.storysanctum.com/forum/viewtopic.php?f=22&amp;t=942 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Please come on over to the Story Sanctum chat site and see if the Upcoming Blood and Smoke game is for you. We need 20 votes in order to get the venue open, so please show your support if you intend to try out the game or are otherwise interested.<br /> <br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#565759\"><span style=\"font-family:Lucida Grande\">This Blood and Smoke game will focus on the vampires of the Eternal City, Rome itself, after a massive strix attack and infiltration has disrupted the harmony of the city and driven the majority of Elders to Torpor, Flee or Final Death.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#565759\"><span style=\"font-family:Lucida Grande\">The game will Focus on the Horror and Political aspects of Vampire society, using the rules contained in the Barony section of Damnation City, but is not wholly limited to those themes. The players will be given the option of entering as Neonates or Ancillae, to better focus on the kind of game they want to experience with their characters.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#565759\"><span style=\"font-family:Lucida Grande\">The players so inclined will be able to fight and maneuver their way into Political Appointments and Domains in the city, while defending their status and station from the others who wish to possess it themselves. As such, the game will be highly reactive to the players and their decisions</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#565759\"><span style=\"font-family:Lucida Grande\">I will take great care to focus on personal scenes and character development and foresee an average of Two Venue scenes being run a week, with personal/requested scenes being run as often as possible. I also have an AST lined up who will be helping flesh out the venue and take some NPCs for a stroll to interact with the players.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#565759\"><span style=\"font-family:Lucida Grande\">Of course, we are very open to suggestions and questions at all times, don't be shy in asking them. I hope to see the Venue open within two months (probably sooner) of the poll being completed.</span></span></i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3835-\u00falfh\u00e9\u00f0nar","name":"\u00dalfh\u00e9\u00f0nar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T15:43:26-08:00","id":402569,"title":"","content":"Bumping this up and showing support. I believe they're at 13 votes to get this up and running. It'd be great to have another B&amp;S/V:tR 2nd Ed online chronicle going.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4966-katastroph3","name":"Katastroph3","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T07:01:01-08:00","id":403265,"title":"","content":"Yes, We are currently at 13 votes for the game. We require another 7 to start up the venue, so if anyone would like to see it happen, please drop on by and vote in the poll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3835-\u00falfh\u00e9\u00f0nar","name":"\u00dalfh\u00e9\u00f0nar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}